WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.350
As in the last chapter, writing is a
separate script with strict refusals.

2
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:06.552
The plan must be the approved one,

3
00:00:06.552 --> 00:00:09.813
for this tenant and cloud,
and less than a week old.

4
00:00:09.813 --> 00:00:14.241
It can only delete one kind of thing,
a role assignment through its resource,

5
00:00:14.241 --> 00:00:16.599
and it can only shrink a delegated grant.

6
00:00:16.599 --> 00:00:20.625
And it runs as a person, signed in
with the right administrator role.

7
00:00:20.625 --> 00:00:21.687
Why not an app?

8
00:00:21.687 --> 00:00:24.317
Because the permissions
it needs are exactly

9
00:00:24.317 --> 00:00:26.876
the escalation permissions
the sweep flags.

10
00:00:26.876 --> 00:00:31.420
Before each write it re-reads the
target, and skips anything that changed.
